                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Target Signal Generator (ESP32-D0WD-V3)</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">
                            Generates four simultaneous bus signals across non-conflicting GPIOs: <strong>I2C</strong> (SDA GPIO 2, SCL GPIO 4) driving a 128&times;64 SSD1306 OLED, <strong>PWM</strong> (GPIO 18), <strong>UART TX0</strong> (GPIO 1), and bit-banged <strong>SPI</strong> bursts (CS 13, SCK 19, MOSI 27).
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-dark p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                        <i class="fas fa-microchip text-2xl text-accent mb-4"></i>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">4-Channel Analyzer Node (ESP32-S3)</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">
                            Samples contiguous input pins <strong>GPIO 4, 5, 6, and 7</strong> (CH0–CH3) in a single atomic register read (<code class="font-mono text-accent bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">GPIO.in &gt;&gt; 4</code>), timestamping transitions to microsecond precision via <code class="font-mono text-accent bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">esp_timer_get_time()</code>.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-dark p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                        <i class="fas fa-tv text-2xl text-accent mb-4"></i>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Dual-Display Telemetry &amp; UI</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">
                            The generator's <strong>SSD1306 OLED</strong> displays live frame counts and active menu parameters, while the S3's <strong>1.44" ST7735 TFT</strong> (40 MHz hardware SPI) uses an off-screen <code class="font-mono text-accent bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">GFXcanvas16</code> framebuffer for flicker-free waveform rendering.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-dark p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                        <i class="fas fa-gamepad text-2xl text-accent mb-4"></i>
