                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">
                            A <strong>KY-040 rotary encoder</strong> (CLK 5, DT 15, SW 23) lets the user cycle between Baud Rate (4800–115200 bps), PWM Frequency (500–5000 Hz), and Duty Cycle (10%–90%) live. On the S3, the <strong>BOOT button</strong> handles single-tap HOLD/LIVE freeze and long-press 1x/4x/16x timebase zoom.
                        </p>
